version 0.19.0
component q-si7617dn

kind         part
mpn          Si7617DN
manufacturer Vishay Siliconix
category     mosfet_p
datasheet    https://www.vishay.com/docs/65164/si7617dn.pdf

# KiCad official library has no Si7617DN; it borrows the SiS443DN symbol with the same package, pins are governed by the inline table.
symbol power:nmos-5
footprint inductor:powerpak-1212-8

# The part's own ratings (ADR-0026): what the device is, not what the design asks of it.
# Per the Vishay datasheet 65164 (S15-1032-Rev. B), Absolute Maximum Ratings: drain-source voltage
# V_DS -30 V, gate-source voltage V_GS +/- 25 V. The terminal pair names the two pins each rating
# is about: the drain is pin 5, the source pin 1 (S1, S2 and S3 are one node), the gate pin 4.
# Both ratings bound the difference in either direction, so their roles are symmetric (ADR-0075 D2).
# The datasheet writes V_DS as a negative number because the part is P-channel; the rating is the
# magnitude, 30 V.
ratings
  drain_source_voltage  voltage  30V  5 1
  gate_source_voltage   voltage  25V  4 1

pins
  1  S1  passive
  2  S2  passive
  3  S3  passive
  4  G   input
  5  D   passive
